# The /docs site is built by hand (bun run docs:build) and committed, so a
# deploy does not install Docusaurus and run a second bundler to publish a
# page nobody changed. tests/unit/docs-built.test.ts fails when the committed
# site is older than the documents it was built from.

# The service-account JSON, if a copy is ever kept here — downloading it is the
# first step of filling in FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT, so a copy on disk is the
# normal state rather than the odd one. It is the only credential in this repo
# with real power, and the one shape of secret `.env*` above does not cover.
service-account*.json
*service-account.json
.secret/
.secrets/
